Z||000029||rogergarrison||10-27-2000||05:46 PM||||[QUOTE]Originally posted by Homicidal:<BR>My 86 V6, 4speed, turbo, gets 20K out of Bosch Platinum and they still looked new when I changed them. I put new ones in anyway because I already bought them, too hard to get to them more often. Ill check em at 30K next time or If it starts running crappy. Ive got a total around 75K on car, 50K on engine. BTW my beater car (86 towncar) has 90k on one set of Bosch platinum, it has 160K on 5.0 ltr and still runs great. Im not messing with them till it quits or wont start.<p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 10-27-2000).]||||reg||1
